{{For|the launcher allowing players to travel between public islands|Launch Pad (structure)}}
The '''Launch Pad''' is a block that can be placed on a [[Private Island]] that launches a player in the direction they are facing. It is unlocked at {{CollectionLink|Slimeball VII}}. The direction and force of the Launch Pad can be changed by right-clicking it.

